=BB=9Di gian giao d=E1=BB=8Bch, tr=E1=BA=A3 OUT_OF_TRADING_TIME.<br>
      2. Kh=E1=BB=91i l=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3ng kh=E1=BA=A3 d=E1=BB=A5ng kho l=E1=
=BA=BB: n=E1=BA=BFu =3D 0, tr=E1=BA=A3 ODD_LOT_EMPTY.<br>
      3. Domain GDTPRL t=E1=BA=A1i VSD: n=E1=BA=BFu KH kh=C3=B4ng c=C3=B3, =
tr=E1=BA=A3 NO_VSD_DOMAIN.<br>
      4. N=C4=90TCN: n=E1=BA=BFu KH kh=C3=B4ng ph=E1=BA=A3i N=C4=90TCN, tr=
=E1=BA=A3 NOT_PRO_INVESTOR.<br>
      5. Sub-account 88: n=E1=BA=BFu KH ch=C6=B0a c=C3=B3 sub88, tr=E1=BA=
=A3 NO_SUB88 =C4=91=E1=BB=83 App/Web hi=E1=BB=83n th=E1=BB=8B pop-up =C4=90=
=C4=83ng k=C3=BD sub88 thay v=C3=AC pop-up l=E1=BB=97i.<br>
      N=E1=BA=BFu KH =C4=91=C3=A3 c=C3=B3 sub88 + sub86 + l=C3=A0 N=C4=90TC=
N v=C3=A0 c=C3=A1c =C4=91i=E1=BB=81u ki=E1=BB=87n tr=C3=AAn =C4=91=E1=BB=81=
u =C4=91=E1=BA=A1t, tr=E1=BA=A3 eligible =3D true.<br>
      API ch=E1=BB=89 ki=E1=BB=83m tra =C4=91i=E1=BB=81u ki=E1=BB=87n, kh=
=C3=B4ng t=E1=BA=A1o l=E1=BB=87nh v=C3=A0 kh=C3=B4ng thay =C4=91=E1=BB=95i =
